	if applicable; prices

     Extra Features:
	and their prices

     Available Since:
	the date you started shipping the Linux	version

     Countries with Distribution:
	if you ship in too many	countries, regional distribution
	channels are okay.

     Price Range:
	whatever it costs

     Vendor:
	address, phone,	fax, e-mail, contact person

